'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a cape and a [[player card]] in ''[[Helldivers 2]]''.

== Acquisition ==
This [[Cosmetics#Capes and Cards|cosmetic set]], found on page two of the [[Castellan’s Creed Legendary Warbond|Castellan’s Creed]] Legendary [[Warbond]], can be claimed separately for {{Currency|Medals|25|notext}} and 7 [[Medal]]s, respectively.

== Trivia ==
*The name of the cape and player card is a reference to the [https://megalodon.jp/2026-1105-2157-52/https://warhammer40k.wiki.gg:443/wiki/Codex:_Cityfight Cityfight] 3rd Edition Supplement book revolving around Urban Warfare.

